cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Bench in teaching material, cite it like this."
title: "Bench: a study add-in for the Casio fx-CG 50"
abstract: >-
  One .g3a for the Casio fx-CG 50: a paper pacer, uncertainty arithmetic, Leitner
  flashcards, a Markdown reader, a study log, an expression engine, solvers,
  statistics and science screens, written in C against gint.
authors:
  - name: "sarang-cmd"
    alias: "sarang-cmd"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sarang-cmd/bench"
url: "https://bench-sarang-dev.vercel.app"
license: MIT
type: software
keywords:
  - calculator
  - casio
  - fx-cg50
  - gint
  - fxsdk
  - study
